tengine/godot/issues/comments/3441421552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111969#issuecomment-3441421552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111969","id":3441421552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NH-zw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T07:06:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T07:06:29Z","body":"What if the button was next to Settings? There is some space there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3441421552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3441741209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111969#issuecomment-3441741209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111969","id":3441741209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NJM2Z","user":{"login":"coppolaemilio","id":2206700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDY3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2206700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio","html_url":"https://github.com/coppolaemilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T08:17:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T08:17:36Z","body":"> I think it makes sense to move the Remove Missing button up for consistency. It was probably separated because it affects the entire project list, unlike the other buttons, which affect only the selected project(s).\r\n\r\nI think it would be better to get them close to the other buttons, but not sure if it really needs to be separated since it has a confirmation popup telling you it will affect all of them:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"365\" height=\"157\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1392e887-d92c-4759-b56b-f70390aa9fbc\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n> What if the button was next to Settings? There is some space there.\r\n\r\nI wouldn't want to add it next to the settings because it would throw the balance of the window and it would give it way too much visibility. I want there to be a path for people to donate but I don't want them to be annoyed at it. Having it in this corner seems like the simplest way of adding it without touching stuff too much.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3441741209/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3441817996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111969#issuecomment-3441817996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111969","id":3441817996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NJfmM","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T08:32:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T08:33:53Z","body":"This looks great to me!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI agree that the \"Remove Missing\" button is now out of place. Moving it next to the other buttons, with or without separator, sounds good to me.\r\n\r\nThat being said this button is a bit unconventional and rarely used IMO, it's only useful if you have some projects that have been deleted/moved on the filesystem and which Godot cannot track anymore. I don't expect this happens a lot (unless you're an engine contributor making a lot of MRPs), so having a dedicated button for it seems a bit much. It could be shown only if there are any missing projects in the list (either as this button, or an action button on the actual missing projects, or as some overlay message but I don't think we support the EditorToaster in the project manager).\r\n\r\nAnyway none of this should be blocking for this PR, but maybe a first step could still be to move \"Remove Missing\" next to other buttons, and if anyone wants to do further changes, this can be in another PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3441817996/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444004832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111969#issuecomment-3444004832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111969","id":3444004832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NR1fg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","ty